    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Control Yourself</strong> is a puzzle platformer in a similar vein to games like Inside and Limbo. Our hero is a small robot tasked with answering distress calls in space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A long forgotton craft from the first days of space exploration has been located.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Long since thought to have met an untimely end (on its mission to search for life in the far reaches of the cosmos) it appears like a celestial giant on the radar of the ISS Space Recovery And Rescue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A solitary Joybot wakes from sleep and runs diagnostics as it awaits docking to begin its investigations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733870/extras/2a9a22e33acfdafba95bb07c5a32b67a.avif?t=1749153017\" width=616 height=302 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stepping aboard the place appears to be rundown with sign of damage to walkways and interior walls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733870/extras/dafbe95793ec087296593aa624d0f25f.avif?t=1749153017\" width=616 height=190 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no sign of any crew but there are signs of different forms of life all around. A mould like substance grows amid the potted plants that still seem to flourish along the corridors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733870/extras/819a4c8c12a0204fca8c7932930a4640.avif?t=1749153017\" width=616 height=280 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will have to use skills and cunning to make your way to the heart of the ship and uncover the truth that lies within.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733870/extras/0d18482de7dd87fdff583a8a0c56ce54.avif?t=1749153017\" width=616 height=274 /></span>And so begins the adventure, what mysteries will be uncovered as Joybot ventures aboard the vast and foreboding craft?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most of the time you have found your standard setup of a pair of multiaxis arms with grabbing claws and the bipedal multi-terrain base works a treat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733870/extras/5d5ab6053c1cfb7e57015ae3bf91172f.avif?t=1749153017\" width=616 height=198 /></span>Do you like unravelling mysteries, solving puzzles in ingenious ways and exploring strange space craft? If that sounds good then Control Yourself might be for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733870/extras/851d85607af5767abc5a77effb842b69.avif?t=1749153017\" width=616 height=196 /></span>To keep up to date on all things Control Yourself don't forget to wishlist now.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also <strong>251789</strong> ...</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Control Yourself</strong> is a puzzle platformer in a similar vein to games like Inside and Limbo. Our hero is a small robot tasked with answering distress calls in space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A long forgotton craft from the first days of space exploration has been located.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Long since thought to have met an untimely end (on its mission to search for life in the far reaches of the cosmos) it appears like a celestial giant on the radar of the ISS Space Recovery And Rescue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A solitary Joybot wakes from sleep and runs diagnostics as it awaits docking to begin its investigations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733870/extras/2a9a22e33acfdafba95bb07c5a32b67a.avif?t=1749153017\" width=616 height=302 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stepping aboard the place appears to be rundown with sign of damage to walkways and interior walls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733870/extras/dafbe95793ec087296593aa624d0f25f.avif?t=1749153017\" width=616 height=190 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no sign of any crew but there are signs of different forms of life all around. A mould like substance grows amid the potted plants that still seem to flourish along the corridors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733870/extras/819a4c8c12a0204fca8c7932930a4640.avif?t=1749153017\" width=616 height=280 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will have to use skills and cunning to make your way to the heart of the ship and uncover the truth that lies within.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733870/extras/0d18482de7dd87fdff583a8a0c56ce54.avif?t=1749153017\" width=616 height=274 /></span>And so begins the adventure, what mysteries will be uncovered as Joybot ventures aboard the vast and foreboding craft?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most of the time you have found your standard setup of a pair of multiaxis arms with grabbing claws and the bipedal multi-terrain base works a treat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733870/extras/5d5ab6053c1cfb7e57015ae3bf91172f.avif?t=1749153017\" width=616 height=198 /></span>Do you like unravelling mysteries, solving puzzles in ingenious ways and exploring strange space craft? If that sounds good then Control Yourself might be for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2733870/extras/851d85607af5767abc5a77effb842b69.avif?t=1749153017\" width=616 height=196 /></span>To keep up to date on all things Control Yourself don't forget to wishlist now.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also <strong>251789</strong> ...</p>",
    "short_description": "Control Yourself is a single-player 3d puzzle platformer set aboard a recently returned but seemingly derelict old space craft. Solve fiendish puzzles, uncover secrets and upgrade your abilites to finally discover what fate has befallen this vast craft.",
